Leaves do not need to lie at the same depth in the tree.

\code{period_set_order_tree()} checks only that the periods nest.
It does not check, for instance, that the leaves cover the
full span. Labels for totals, as defined by \code{\link[=period_is_total]{period_is_total()}}, are
not part of a reporting tree, and cause an error.
Some tables use \code{"Total"} to mean period not stated. In such
